('virtual-assistant-article-approval-conditions', 'Record Conditional Approval in Virtual Assistant Article Work', 'conditional approval', 'separating a real release decision from approval that depends on a named correction', 'version, condition, approver, affected check, expiry, and final confirmation', 'A virtual assistant can track conditions; it cannot infer approval from silence or an older version.'),
('virtual-assistant-reader-question-triage', 'Triage Reader Questions for Better Virtual Assistant Articles', 'reader-question triage', 'turning reader confusion into a bounded decision about correction, clarification, or a new article', 'original question, route, location, evidence need, duplicate check, and owner', 'Support can classify and route; the editor decides public response and scope.'),
