('virtual-assistant-editorial-decision-notes', 'Write Better Editorial Decision Notes with Virtual Assistant Help', 'decision notes', 'preserving why an article choice was made so the queue does not reopen the same uncertainty', 'question, options considered, evidence, chosen path, limits, date, and reopening trigger', 'Support can format and retrieve notes; editorial leadership owns the decision.'),
